{"author":"did:key:z6Mkmz8SWiUshwDMszSqwzMngt7ScNmsEj7vZoFRLjpcZTm9","evaluation":{"digest":{"sha256":"b269d48abae144858ef89b051ea8242b8a51f27a8fc02fe98c4e71f14280d9ef"}},"instructions":"Return exactly ACCEPT or REJECT.","network.jinn.binary-judgment.item-sha256":"sha256:7fac96803bd0954bb8aec23b8a3475316147d4e17fd79f1e67b769f79b2f69ad","outputs":[{"mediaType":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","name":"judge-response","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.jinn.binary-judgment.observation.v1+json","name":"judge-observation","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.inspect-ai.eval-log+json","name":"inspect-log","required":false}],"payload":{"candidateAnswer":"Tattoo of her four dogs","evidence":"[D3:26 | 4:19 pm on 16 April, 2023] Audrey: I know right? They mean the world to me. So much that I got tattoos of them on my arm.\n[D15:1 | 9:58 pm on 16 August, 2023] Audrey: Hey Andrew, since we last spoke I got another tattoo of my four dogs on my arm! They really mean a lot to me so I thought it'd be nice to have them with me wherever I go. What've you been up to?\n[D23:20 | 4:22 pm on 13 October, 2023] Audrey: Thanks! I think right now its enough. Unless someday I decide to get another dog. Maybe I'll get another tattoo when that happens.","itemId":"urn:uuid:7e59170c-8515-5110-84ee-11e82c2baf4c","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:6cf6d40e41d9bb7cddb493eee14fcc579acd816b2d947f096364c5c469c5ceaa","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What kind of tattoo does Audrey have on her arm?","referenceAnswer":"Tattoos of her four dogs.","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"6cf6d40e41d9bb7cddb493eee14fcc579acd816b2d947f096364c5c469c5ceaa"}}]},"profile":{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb34d8362e2cc3135847a5ad6f3ee3d9c2d9922a2b827aa9dfcbaf440b22557"},"uri":"https://spec.jinn.network/task-profiles/binary-judgment/2.0"},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/profiles/task-execution/v1"}